WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
A taxi: £3, plus £2 per km.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:07.550
The fare is £15.

00:00:07.550 --> 00:00:09.830
How far did you go?

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.090
Let k be the kilometres.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.020
3 + 2k = 15.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:18.600
Take 3: 2k = 12

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:21.013
k = 6 km
